Verdict
-------
HONEST STOP — NO TUPLE passes all 3 gates.

  - The smallest max |bfly Δ| across the entire grid is 91.48 %
    (IDENTITY=1.15 DCT2X2=1.10) — far above the 3 % bar.
  - Best avg bytes Δ is -0.509 % (IDENTITY=1.10 DCT2X2=1.10) —
    passes gate 1 but the same tuple has max |bfly| 115.9 % and
    only 56 % of cells under |bfly| ≤ 2 %.
  - The "closest" tuple (avg bytes negative + smallest max |bfly|)
    is IDENTITY=1.15 DCT2X2=1.10: avg bytes -0.399 %, max |bfly|
    91.48 %, 14/27 cells failing gate 2.

